{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "This market is more predictable today than it has been in five years. And that is exactly what makes it dangerous. Because when the numbers are published and the pipeline is booked out till twenty twenty-eight or twenty-nine and you can see the whole thing coming, you don't get to call it a bad luck afterwards. You get to call it", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000001"}], "text": "The Dubai real estate market is more predictable today than it has been in five years, making it dangerous because when the numbers and pipeline are visible, you can't blame bad luck later; it becomes a decision."}, "title": "Dubai real estate market predictability", "topic": "Dubai real estate"}, "content_hash": "5c89d776c2414201c1bca01c1b979029213c868e03fe68a41eebc4b4ff575eac", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:knowledge:6105d861d9c6c67b", "metadata_hash": "077b474820164df52a9c80be5313e6985edbec7b721135ac6d567febe65d043f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-17", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7a8ccc5e596c521608c244164ee507ce1b30ca75eb6ff8ce40c6756ab041d3d4", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kd7guhR2AKI", "title": "Dubai real estate market predictability", "topic": "Dubai real estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I don't sell properties and I'm not going to benefit anything from you buying, selling or running away from this market. What I'm going to do is show you the market data for ready property, rents and off plant.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000002"}], "text": "The author states they do not sell properties and will not benefit from viewers' decisions to buy, sell, or leave the market; their role is to show market data related to ready property, rents, and off-plan sales."}, "title": "Author's role in video content", "topic": "Author's role"}, "content_hash": "5c89d776c2414201c1bca01c1b979029213c868e03fe68a41eebc4b4ff575eac", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:knowledge:76d6544a450ceaf5", "metadata_hash": "077b474820164df52a9c80be5313e6985edbec7b721135ac6d567febe65d043f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-17", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7a8ccc5e596c521608c244164ee507ce1b30ca75eb6ff8ce40c6756ab041d3d4", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kd7guhR2AKI", "title": "Author's role in video content", "topic": "Author's role", "topic_slug": "author-s-role"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000003", "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000004", "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000005"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "quarterly price growth in Dubai turned negative in a fourth quarter of", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000003"}, {"quote": "The correction was booked in by supply. The regional tension just got to blame.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000004"}], "text": "Quarterly price growth in Dubai turned negative in Q4 2025, with a correction attributed to supply before geopolitical events."}, "title": "Discussion of real estate market conditions", "topic": "Real estate conditions"}, "content_hash": "5c89d776c2414201c1bca01c1b979029213c868e03fe68a41eebc4b4ff575eac", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:knowledge:fe9119f1183fa415", "metadata_hash": "077b474820164df52a9c80be5313e6985edbec7b721135ac6d567febe65d043f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-17", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7a8ccc5e596c521608c244164ee507ce1b30ca75eb6ff8ce40c6756ab041d3d4", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kd7guhR2AKI", "title": "Discussion of real estate market conditions", "topic": "Real estate conditions", "topic_slug": "real-estate-conditions"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000007"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "A ready owner has a choice. Nothing forces him to transact. He can wait a quarter, watch, maybe list again, September, October, November. An off-plan buyer on a payment plan has no such luxury.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000007"}], "text": "Ready property owners have the option to wait and not transact, unlike off-plan buyers bound by installment schedules."}, "title": "Observation about ready property owners", "topic": "Property ownership strategy"}, "content_hash": "5c89d776c2414201c1bca01c1b979029213c868e03fe68a41eebc4b4ff575eac", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:knowledge:e7d7471c017c0d7f", "metadata_hash": "077b474820164df52a9c80be5313e6985edbec7b721135ac6d567febe65d043f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-17", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7a8ccc5e596c521608c244164ee507ce1b30ca75eb6ff8ce40c6756ab041d3d4", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kd7guhR2AKI", "title": "Observation about ready property owners", "topic": "Property ownership strategy", "topic_slug": "property-ownership-strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000010", "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000011"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "two hundred and seventy-seven thousand rental contracts registered in the first half. It just down three percent compared to two thousand twenty-five.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000010"}, {"quote": "The new tenant market shrink.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000011"}], "text": "There were 277,000 rental contracts registered, down 3% compared to 2025, with 182,000 renewals indicating that the new rental market has shrunk."}, "title": "Change in rental contracts", "topic": "Rental market"}, "content_hash": "5c89d776c2414201c1bca01c1b979029213c868e03fe68a41eebc4b4ff575eac", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:knowledge:4c082c6851c2a743", "metadata_hash": "077b474820164df52a9c80be5313e6985edbec7b721135ac6d567febe65d043f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-17", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7a8ccc5e596c521608c244164ee507ce1b30ca75eb6ff8ce40c6756ab041d3d4", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kd7guhR2AKI", "title": "Change in rental contracts", "topic": "Rental market", "topic_slug": "rental-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000025"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "If you're buying, you're buying into a delivery cycle, not a launch cycle. That is a completely different market from what your friends bought two, three years ago. And the strategies that worked for them are the one most likely to hurt you now. If you are holding and planning where to sell, separate your two reasons. Do you really need this? money or you are just afraid of the crash.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000025"}], "text": "If you're buying, understand you are entering a delivery cycle, not a launch cycle, which is different from the market a few years ago. Separate reasons for holding and planning to sell, considering whether the need is urgent or due to fear of a market crash."}, "title": "Real estate market strategy advice", "topic": "Market strategy"}, "content_hash": "5c89d776c2414201c1bca01c1b979029213c868e03fe68a41eebc4b4ff575eac", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:knowledge:ff01e1506b2ef722", "metadata_hash": "077b474820164df52a9c80be5313e6985edbec7b721135ac6d567febe65d043f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-17", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7a8ccc5e596c521608c244164ee507ce1b30ca75eb6ff8ce40c6756ab041d3d4", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kd7guhR2AKI", "title": "Real estate market strategy advice", "topic": "Market strategy", "topic_slug": "market-strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000015", "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000016"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "Last month, four investors came to my unbiased coaching session with the same problem. Every one of them bought off-plan and planned to sell before the handover.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000015"}], "text": "Four investors attended a coaching session reporting issues with off-plan purchases and resale plans."}, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": {"citations": [{"quote": "not one of them can now. Two of them cannot make the next installment. One has already almost quarter million dirhams in late payment fees and developer keep charging more.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000016"}], "text": "None of the investors can currently sell, two cannot make the next installment, and one has significant late payment fees."}, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Last month, four investors came to my unbiased coaching session with the same problem. Every one of them bought off-plan and planned to sell before the handover.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000015"}], "text": "Investors in the real estate market faced challenges due to changes in the market conditions."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Impact of market conditions on investors", "topic": "Investment effects"}, "content_hash": "5c89d776c2414201c1bca01c1b979029213c868e03fe68a41eebc4b4ff575eac", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:cases:734e2a9ff4a57feb", "metadata_hash": "077b474820164df52a9c80be5313e6985edbec7b721135ac6d567febe65d043f", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-09-17", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7a8ccc5e596c521608c244164ee507ce1b30ca75eb6ff8ce40c6756ab041d3d4", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kd7guhR2AKI", "title": "Impact of market conditions on investors", "topic": "Investment effects", "topic_slug": "investment-effects"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000013"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "The second one has stopped. This market pays you an income, not an increase. And if you already own, the tenants sitting inside your property today is worth more than the one you will imagine gonna come next.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000013"}], "text": "Landlords faced challenges with rental renewals and the changing market value of occupied versus prospective tenants."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Challenges with rental strategy", "topic": "Rental strategy"}, "content_hash": "5c89d776c2414201c1bca01c1b979029213c868e03fe68a41eebc4b4ff575eac", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:cases:5163ede8e6368127", "metadata_hash": "077b474820164df52a9c80be5313e6985edbec7b721135ac6d567febe65d043f", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-09-17", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7a8ccc5e596c521608c244164ee507ce1b30ca75eb6ff8ce40c6756ab041d3d4", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kd7guhR2AKI", "title": "Challenges with rental strategy", "topic": "Rental strategy", "topic_slug": "rental-strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000001"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "This market is more predictable today than it has been in five years. And that is exactly what makes it dangerous. Because when the numbers are published and the pipeline is booked out till twenty twenty-eight or twenty-nine and you can see the whole thing coming, you don't get to call it a bad luck afterwards. You get to call it", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000001"}], "text": "The speaker explains that the predictability of the Dubai real estate market makes it dangerous, connecting the ability to foresee trends with the loss of blaming 'bad luck' and emphasizing the inevitability of decision-making."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Explanation of market predictability", "topic": "Market predictability"}, "content_hash": "5c89d776c2414201c1bca01c1b979029213c868e03fe68a41eebc4b4ff575eac", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:expression:adb81c899710e53e", "metadata_hash": "077b474820164df52a9c80be5313e6985edbec7b721135ac6d567febe65d043f", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-17", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7a8ccc5e596c521608c244164ee507ce1b30ca75eb6ff8ce40c6756ab041d3d4", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kd7guhR2AKI", "title": "Explanation of market predictability", "topic": "Market predictability", "topic_slug": "market-predictability"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000013"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "And if you already own, the tenants sitting inside your property today is worth more than the one you will imagine gonna come next. Two third of this market is renewals. Push too hard, you're gonna lose them and you're gonna be hunting for replacement in the pool which shrank by five thousand contracts this year.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:u000013"}], "text": "The speaker analyzes the rental market by contrasting past profitability from rent increments with the current situation where continued income depends on retaining existing tenants, explaining the implications of a shrinking tenant pool."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Analysis of rental market dynamics", "topic": "Real estate analysis"}, "content_hash": "5c89d776c2414201c1bca01c1b979029213c868e03fe68a41eebc4b4ff575eac", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5:expression:50aea6479927bfbc", "metadata_hash": "077b474820164df52a9c80be5313e6985edbec7b721135ac6d567febe65d043f", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-17", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7a8ccc5e596c521608c244164ee507ce1b30ca75eb6ff8ce40c6756ab041d3d4", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-17-dubai-6-months-after-the-war-ready-sales-26-flips-halved-162-3167b6efe5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kd7guhR2AKI", "title": "Analysis of rental market dynamics", "topic": "Real estate analysis", "topic_slug": "real-estate-analysis"}
